# OLA RADIO — INDEPENDENT ANDROID INVESTIGATION

## Version 2.1 — Runtime Debugging, Network Anomalies & Technical Verification

**Project:** Ola Radio Independent Investigation  
**Application:** Ola Radio  
**Package:** `com.aewt.app.friends`  
**Application version:** 2.5.9  
**Version code:** 49  
**Target SDK:** 36  
**Test environment:** Kali Linux and Android tablet  
**Investigation date:** 17 November 2026  
**Status:** Open investigation — suspicious behaviour identified; further verification required

